# TwelveData API Key — required for Forex & Commodities live prices
# Sign up free at https://twelvedata.com → Dashboard → API Keys
# Free tier: 8 requests/min, 800/day. Sufficient for 30s polling.
# Symbols covered: EUR/USD, GBP/USD, USD/JPY, XAU/USD, WTI/USD (crude oil)
VITE_TWELVEDATA_API_KEY=YOUR_TWELVEDATA_KEY_HERE
